# AI order assistant (Vercel AI Gateway)
# On Vercel deployments: OIDC auth is automatic — you usually do NOT need AI_GATEWAY_API_KEY.
# For local dev: run `vercel env pull .env.local` (gets VERCEL_OIDC_TOKEN) or set AI_GATEWAY_API_KEY.
AI_CHAT_MODEL="cursor/composer-2.5-fast"
AI_CHAT_MODEL_FALLBACK="google/gemini-2.5-flash"
